{"id":"n84515-1-7","stage":5,"title":"플러그 · 插头","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84515-1-7-1","ko":"어? 이상하다, 왜 컴퓨터가 안 켜지지?","zh":"咦？真奇怪，为什么电脑打不开啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어?","meaning":"咦","explanation":"어：咦","readings":[{"term":"어","audio":"/audio/228794e2524374dc8637.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26153","senseId":"1","lemma":"어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이상하다,","meaning":"奇怪，古怪","explanation":"이상하다：奇怪，古怪；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"이상하다","audio":"/audio/8ccfeb4ba665917849ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71167","senseId":"2","lemma":"이상하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"컴퓨터가","meaning":"电脑","explanation":"컴퓨터：电脑；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"컴퓨터","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72167","senseId":"1","lemma":"컴퓨터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"켜지지?","meaning":"打开，发动；表示成为前面表达的那样。","explanation":"켜다：打开，发动；지다：表示成为前面表达的那样。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"켜다","audio":"/audio/c21cbaed08b52b5bb6d4.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72168","senseId":"2","lemma":"켜다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"2","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"228794e2524374dc","term":"어","zh":"咦","audio":"/audio/228794e2524374dc8637.mp3","entryId":"26153","definition":"感到惊讶、慌张、焦急、急促时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["어"]},{"id":"8ccfeb4ba6659178","term":"이상하다","zh":"奇怪，古怪","audio":"/audio/8ccfeb4ba665917849ed.mp3","entryId":"71167","definition":"和原本知道的东西不同，特别或独特。","pronunciation":["이ː상하다"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"cff8b01657dff709","term":"컴퓨터","zh":"电脑","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3","entryId":"72167","definition":"利用电路线快速、准确地处理文件、照片、影像等大量数据的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"c21cbaed08b52b5b","term":"켜다","zh":"打开，发动","audio":"/audio/c21cbaed08b52b5bb6d4.mp3","entryId":"72168","definition":"让电器等运转。","pronunciation":["켜다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/08326436bff707742f9d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n84515-1-7-2","ko":"컴퓨터의 플러그를 안 꽂았잖아.","zh":"电脑的插头还没插上啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"컴퓨터의","meaning":"电脑","explanation":"컴퓨터：电脑；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"컴퓨터","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72167","senseId":"1","lemma":"컴퓨터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"플러그를","meaning":"插头，插座","explanation":"플러그：插头，插座；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"플러그","audio":"/audio/8cdd4885b49f600b8ef0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84515","senseId":"1","lemma":"플러그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꽂았잖아.","meaning":"插","explanation":"꽂다：插；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"꽂다","audio":"/audio/3781a022a4ddbaed1cbe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14413","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽂다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"cff8b01657dff709","term":"컴퓨터","zh":"电脑","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3","entryId":"72167","definition":"利用电路线快速、准确地处理文件、照片、影像等大量数据的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"8cdd4885b49f600b","term":"플러그","zh":"插头，插座","audio":"/audio/8cdd4885b49f600b8ef0.mp3","entryId":"84515","definition":"为连接或截断电路而装在电线末端的装置。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"3781a022a4ddbaed","term":"꽂다","zh":"插","audio":"/audio/3781a022a4ddbaed1cbe.mp3","entryId":"14413","definition":"把东西挤入某个地方，或放进去后立在那里。","pronunciation":["꼳따"]}],"audio":"/audio/1ad747e4778f15f0d945.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.427,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=84515","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":163,"sequenceScore":3.2537,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["咦？真奇怪，为什么电脑打不开啊？","电脑的插头还没插上啊。","我送的玩具，你弟弟好像很喜欢吧？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["咦？真奇怪，为什么电脑打不开啊？","电脑的插头还没插上啊。","我送的玩具，你弟弟好像很喜欢吧？"],"answer":1}]}
